! Original OpenSwing inverse time-target demonstrator, SI units.
! A 1 kg rigid body with principal inertias (2,3,4) kg m^2.
! E1 applies E1 newtons along +x at the mass center.
! E2 applies E2 newton-metres about +z, with zero thrust.
! Use zero gravity, free flight, speed 10, alpha 0, four panels.
! Time actuator target: E1 Ax .2. Forcing: time +Ax / 0 0 / .12 .12.
! Exact required E1 = .2+t. Origin velocity x = -10+.2*t+.5*t^2.
